  "description": "Convert HTML and Markdown to DOCX and PDF; render DOCX, XLSX and PPTX to PDF; export DOCX to\n      HTML/Markdown and XLSX to CSV/HTML; read legacy Word 97-2003 .doc files; read text out of a\n      PDF; create/edit DOCX, XLSX and PPTX; and password-protect PDF, DOCX, XLSX and PPTX - pure\n      managed, no native binaries, no browser, no LibreOffice, no Office interop. Runs on Linux,\n      Windows and macOS, and makes no network calls at runtime.",
